sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Tenant
    participant G as Gateway pod
    participant M as Bellek (kurallar)
    participant R as Redis
    participant S as payment-service

    C->>G: POST /payments (X-API-Key)
    G->>M: sha256(key) → tenant_42, PRO
    G->>M: kuralları çöz: genel(500/s, TENANT) + endpoint(50/s, PLAN) + kota
    G->>R: EVALSHA token_bucket.lua (2 kova + kota, hepsi ya da hiçbiri)
    alt kovalardan biri boş / kota dolu
        R-->>G: allowed=0
        G-->>C: 429 + Retry-After + X-RateLimit-*
    else hepsinde jeton var
        R-->>G: allowed=1, remaining
        G->>R: global kova
        alt global kapasite dolu
            G->>R: kota iadesi (DECR)
            G-->>C: 503 system_overloaded
        else
            G->>S: isteği ilet (X-API-Key silinir, X-Tenant-Id eklenir)
            S-->>G: 201 / 5xx
            opt 5xx
                G->>R: kota iadesi (DECR)
            end
            G-->>C: cevap + X-RateLimit-* header'ları
        end
    end
